flowchart LR
  user[Пользователь / инженер] --> cf[Cloudflare DNS only]
  user --> yc[Yandex Cloud]
  cf --> ingress_ip[Ingress NLB IP]
  yc --> tf[Terraform]
  tf --> vm[VM: control-plane и worker]
  vm --> k8s[Kubernetes kubeadm HA]
  k8s --> platform[Platform services]
  platform --> gitlab[GitLab / Registry / Runner]
  platform --> vault[Vault HA]
  platform --> obs[Prometheus / Grafana / Loki / Alloy]
  gitlab --> registry[Container Registry]
  registry --> apps[API / Gateway / Frontend]
  apps --> data[(PostgreSQL / Redis)]
  obs --> tests[Отчёты тестирования]
